{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The five digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c10a61be02be3606a98e013fce75f972145276d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55225$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> are such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1404545adf49090812f9934d4f365c59bdee4c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=e$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c58ab3d7140fd1de26a1f70f86718703a2569479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=d$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />; in addition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/c/ecc5d297e083237c0543a09e083ee23f0a199a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55225=235^2=(235)(235)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"19\" />.\nFind another integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> is also a five digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/18396b1d04475fed55fd7c1b75cd4d85133210be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abcde$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/4/b1404545adf49090812f9934d4f365c59bdee4c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=e$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c58ab3d7140fd1de26a1f70f86718703a2569479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=d$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/4/af4c37ff1a89a2667cb70c3e6e731b7040a36bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$109$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key<